\newlabel{tab:overhead-cells}{{S15}{18}{\textbf {Primary model--protocol inclusive generation time and payload throughput.} Llama denotes Meta-Llama-3-8B-Instruct, Qwen denotes Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, and Mistral denotes Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3; all use the reported Q4\_K\_M configurations. Parentheses contain payload-bootstrap 95\% confidence intervals}{table.caption.19}{}}
